What is Green Cleaning?
Green cleaning represents a holistic approach to hygiene that balances efficacy with environmental responsibility. Products are engineered to be low impact across their entire lifecycle-starting from sourcing renewable, biodegradable raw materials, through manufacturing processes that minimise energy use, to end of life disposal that encourages recycling or safe biodegradation. The core philosophy is to deliver a clean environment without compromising human health or the planet.
